5. Troubleshooting

Issue	Cause	Resolution
No master found in Sentinel	Sentinel misconfigured	Verify SENTINEL_SERVICE_NAME and port 26379
Quorum not reached (WARN)	Fewer than 2 healthy nodes	Restart failed Redis nodes
Key length error in encryption	Wrong key/nonce length	Use 64‑hex key and 12/24 byte nonce
Browser freeze on large input	Input >1MB for SHA3/Argon2	Use smaller input or tweak Argon2 memory cost
Signature shows ✗ INVALID	Keypair mismatch or data error	Regenerate keypair and retry signing & verification
